{"id":762,"date":"2022-12-05T18:09:27","date_gmt":"2022-12-05T08:39:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?page_id=762"},"modified":"2025-11-04T07:57:26","modified_gmt":"2025-11-03T22:27:26","slug":"privacy-policy","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/privacy-policy\/","title":{"rendered":"Privacy Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"762\" class=\"elementor elementor-762\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-9eadff0 elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"9eadff0\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f29bae1\" data-id=\"f29bae1\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea5d4b0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ea5d4b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FeedOps Privacy Policy<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-767f5ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"767f5ad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Your privacy is important to us. This privacy policy explains how we handle your personal information.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-145cf99 elementor-section-content-top elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"145cf99\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0f6ed96\" data-id=\"0f6ed96\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60d5def elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"60d5def\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Website Visitors<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bd0d8fa elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bd0d8fa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #333333;\">Like most website operators, Feedops Pty Ltd collects non-personally-identifying information of the sort that web browsers and servers typically make available, such as the browser type, language preference, referring site, and the date and time of each visitor request. Feedops Pty Ltd\u2019s purpose in collecting non-personally identifying information is to better understand how Feedops Pty Ltd\u2019s visitors use its website. From time to time, Feedops Pty Ltd may release non-personally-identifying information in the aggregate, e.g., by publishing a report on trends in the usage of its website.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #333333;\">Feedops Pty Ltd also collects potentially personally-identifying information like Internet Protocol (IP) addresses. Feedops Pty Ltd does not use such information to identify its visitors, however, and does not disclose such information, other than under the same circumstances that it uses and discloses personally-identifying information, as described below.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #333333;\">Certain visitors to Feedops Pty Ltd\u2019s websites choose to interact with Feedops Pty Ltd in ways that require Feedops Pty Ltd to gather personally-identifying information such as when we ask for your name, email address and a contact number. We use the information to provide access to reports, whitepapers and newsletters, register for events\/webinars, apply for employment or to follow up on requests for information. The amount and type of information that Feedops Pty Ltd gathers depends on the nature of the interaction. In each case, Feedops Pty Ltd collects such information only insofar as is necessary or appropriate to fulfill the purpose of the visitor\u2019s interaction with Feedops Pty Ltd. Feedops Pty Ltd does not disclose personally-identifying information. Unless visitors have informed Feedops Pty Ltd that they do not wish to receive further information in the future, Feedops Pty Ltd may send them direct mail. Site visitors can always refuse to supply personally-identifying information, though doing so may prevent them from engaging in certain website-related activities. FeedOps does not share any user data with third-party tools, including AI models.<\/span><\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Feedops Pty Ltd Ad Platform<\/b><\/span><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #333333;\">The Feedops Pty Ltd Ad Platform accesses, uses, and stores Google Ads, Google Analytics, and Google Merchant Center data in order to manage customer advertising campaigns and report on their performance.<\/span><\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Aggregated Statistics<\/b><\/span><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #333333;\">Feedops Pty Ltd may collect statistics about the behaviour of visitors to its websites. Feedops Pty Ltd may display this information publicly or provide it to others in aggregate or anonymised form. However, Feedops Pty Ltd does not disclose personally-identifying information other than as described in this document.<\/span><\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Cookies<\/b><\/span><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #333333;\">A cookie is a piece of information that a website may store on a visitor\u2019s computer, and that the visitor\u2019s browser provides back to the website each time the visitor returns. Feedops Pty Ltd uses cookies to help Feedops Pty Ltd identify and track visitors, and their use of the Feedops Pty Ltd website. Feedops Pty Ltd visitors who do not wish to have cookies placed on their computers should set their browsers to warn you each time a cookie is being sent, or to refuse cookies before using Feedops Pty Ltd\u2019s websites, though in doing so certain features of Feedops Pty Ltd\u2019s website may not function properly without the aid of cookies. However, you are still able to contact us directly via email or over the telephone.<\/span><\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Digital Marketing\u200b<\/b><\/span><\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This website uses information gathered through Google Analytics, to guide digital marketing activities, such as remarketing, on third party sites. This information, in conjunction with cookies, may be used to serve ads for Feedops Pty Ltd on 3rd party sites, based on past visits to the website. Additionally, interest based data from Google and\/or 3rd party audience data may be used to target specific placements or demographics, through the Google Display Network. All information is anonymous and not identifiable to a specific person.\u00a0 You can change the ways in which your Google information is used, or opt-out, here (<\/span><a style=\"color: #333333;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/ads\/preferences\"><b>http:\/\/www.google.com\/ads\/preferences<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">). Alternatively, the way in which your browser manages cookies can be adjusted, see here (<\/span><a style=\"color: #333333;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com.au\/policies\/technologies\/managing\/\"><b>http:\/\/www.google.com.au\/policies\/technologies\/managing\/<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">).<\/span><\/span><\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Third Party Cookies\u200b<\/b><\/span><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Feedops Pty Ltd sometimes embeds photos and video content from websites such as YouTube, Facebook or flickr and pages with this embedded content may present cookies from these websites. Similarly, when a visitor uses one of the share buttons on the Feedops Pty Ltd website, a cookie may be set by the service the visitor chose to share content through. Feedops Pty Ltd does not control the dissemination of these cookies. Visitors concerned about the privacy details of third party cookies must check the relevant third party website for more information about these cookies. Feedops Pty Ltd does not sell the information collected by cookies, nor disclose the information to other third parties, except where to comply with the law, or to protect our or others\u2019 rights, property or safety (for example to government bodies and law enforcement agencies).<\/span><\/p><h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Amazon Data Compliance<\/b><\/span><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">FeedOps complies with Amazon\u2019s Data Protection Policies, which apply to any data obtained via Amazon Marketplace Web Service (MWS) APIs. This section outlines specific practices in alignment with Amazon\u2019s requirements:<\/span><\/p><ol><li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b> General Security Requirements<\/b><\/span><\/li><\/ol><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">FeedOps implements physical, administrative, and technical safeguards to protect Amazon information.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Data is secured against threats, accidental loss, and unauthorized processing.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><ol start=\"2\"><li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b> Encryption<\/b><\/span><\/li><\/ol><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Data in transit is encrypted using HTTPS.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Personally Identifiable Information (PII) is encrypted at rest using AES-256 standards.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><ol start=\"3\"><li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b> Access Management<\/b><\/span><\/li><\/ol><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">FeedOps does not retain Amazon data beyond transient processing needs.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">No PII is downloaded onto external devices. Suspicious activity, such as multiple failed logins, is flagged, and access is revoked if necessary.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><ol start=\"4\"><li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b> Data Retention and Disposal<\/b><\/span><\/li><\/ol><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">FeedOps does not retain Amazon data beyond transient processing needs. All accessed data is purged immediately after use.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Upon Amazon\u2019s request, FeedOps ensures no residual data remains and certifies compliance.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><ol start=\"5\"><li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b> Logging and Monitoring<\/b><\/span><\/li><\/ol><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">FeedOps does not retain Amazon data beyond transient processing needs. No Amazon data is logged and monitored, only the error responses from marketplace API calls are logged and monitored.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><ol start=\"6\"><li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b> Incident Response Plan<\/b><\/span><\/li><\/ol><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">FeedOps maintains a response plan for security incidents. Any Amazon data breach is reported to 3p-security@amazon.com within 24 hours of discovery.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Incident documentation is maintained and reviewed regularly.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><ol start=\"7\"><li><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b> Audit Compliance<\/b><\/span><\/li><\/ol><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">FeedOps provides records demonstrating compliance with Amazon\u2019s policies upon request.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">FeedOps cooperates with Amazon audits, addressing deficiencies at its own expense.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Every user is entitled to the following:<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">The right to access \u2013 You have the right to request Feedops Pty Ltd for copies of your personal data. We may charge you a small fee for this service.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">The right to rectification \u2013 You have the right to request that Feedops Pty Ltd correct any information you believe is inaccurate. You also have the right to request Feedops Pty Ltd to complete the information you believe is incomplete.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">The right to erasure \u2013 You have the right to request that Feedops Pty Ltd erase your personal data, under certain conditions.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">The right to restrict processing \u2013 You have the right to request that Feedops Pty Ltd restrict the processing of your personal data, under certain conditions.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">The right to object to processing \u2013 You have the right to object to Feedops Pty Ltd\u2019s processing of your personal data, under certain conditions.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">The right to data portability \u2013 You have the right to request that Feedops Pty Ltd transfer the data that we have collected to another organisation, or directly to you, under certain conditions.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">If you make a request, we have one month to respond to you. If you would like to exercise any of these rights, please contact us:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Email: data-protection@feedops.com<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Mail: 178 Grote Street, Adelaide, South Australia 5000.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Privacy Policy Changes<\/b><\/span><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">Although most changes are likely to be minor, Feedops Pty Ltd may change its Privacy Policy from time to time, and in Feedops Pty Ltd\u2019s sole discretion. Feedops Pty Ltd encourages visitors to frequently check this page for any changes to its Privacy Policy. Your continued use of this site after any change in this Privacy Policy will constitute your acceptance of such change.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: #000000;\">This Privacy Policy was last updated 9 June, 2020.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>FeedOps Privacy Policy Your privacy is important to us. This privacy policy explains how we handle your personal information. Website Visitors Like most website operators, Feedops Pty Ltd collects non-personally-identifying information of the sort that web browsers and servers typically make available, such as the browser type, language preference, referring site, and the date and [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":8,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-762","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Privacy Policy - FeedOps<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Learn how FeedOps protects your personal data with strong encryption, limited retention, and full compliance with Google and Amazon.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, nofollow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/privacy-policy\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Privacy Policy\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Learn how FeedOps protects your personal data with strong encryption, limited retention, and full compliance with Google and Amazon.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/privacy-policy\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-11-03T22:27:26+00:00\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"6 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/privacy-policy\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/privacy-policy\/\",\"name\":\"Privacy Policy - FeedOps\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\"},\"datePublished\":\"2022-12-05T08:39:27+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-11-03T22:27:26+00:00\",\"description\":\"Learn how FeedOps protects your personal data with strong encryption, limited retention, and full compliance with Google and Amazon.\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/privacy-policy\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/privacy-policy\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/privacy-policy\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Privacy Policy\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\",\"name\":\"FeedOps\",\"description\":\"\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTe